    Codification: Act 28 - Act 21 Exact-Tree Attestation Amendment Act (enacted 7-6-1-0)
    
    Adds the codified Act 28 entry from the enacted bill text (digest 5046072...): verified candidate vs
    status carrier, one fast-forward integration, direct-child base/range predicate, the evidence limits
    (chronology not execution proof; unreadable never compliant), reporting separation, and the Executive
    implementation duty with all ten hermetic cases.
    
    Amends the codified Act 21 in place at s1, s2, s3 and s5 with explicit 'as amended by Act 28' sentences
    so the codified text does not contradict the amendment; s4 and s6 are unchanged. government/LAWS.md only.
    
    Clause 8 records, without resolving, the interaction the Auditor identified before verification: Act 26's
    post-landing suite-status sentence and Act 28's pre-landing carrier name two commit homes for the same
    file, and no enacted text says which prevails for a carrier unit. Codifying the enacted text and naming
    the conflict is faithful; choosing between them silently would be the Clerk legislating.

